{"ref":"BDB, אֵמֻן","hw":"אֵמֻן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֵמֻן</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>trusting, faithfulness (</strong>on format. cf. Ges<sup>§ 84 a R. 12</sup><strong>)</strong>.<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּנִים לֹא אֵמֻן בָּם</span> <em>children in whom there is no trusting</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.20\">Dt 32:20</a> (poet.)<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱמוּנִים</span> pl. abst. <em>faithfulness;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">צִיר א׳</span> <em>messenger of faithfulness</em>, trusty messenger <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.17\">Pr 13:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵד א׳</span> <em>faithful witness</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.5\">Pr 14:5</a>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:6\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.6\">Pr 20:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁמֵר א׳</span> <em>keeping faithfulness</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.2\">Is 26:2</a>; perhaps also <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:24\" href=\"/Psalms.31.24\">ψ 31:24</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">נצר א׳</span> v. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, אָמַן\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_אָמַן\">I.</a> [<a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, אָמַן\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_אָמַן\">אָמַן</a>].","next":"BDB, אֱמוּנָה","prev":"BDB, אָמָּן"}